= form_with model: @tag, class: "space-y-5" do |f|
  - if @tag.errors.any?
    .rounded-md.border.border-red-200.bg-red-50.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-red-900
      ul.list-inside.list-disc
        - @tag.errors.full_messages.each do |msg|
          li = msg

  div
    = f.label :name, "タグ名", class: "mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800"
    = f.text_field :name, autocomplete: "off", class: memo_form_underline_input
    p.mt-1.text-xs.text-zinc-500 表示名が変わります。同一の表記（大文字小文字・前後空白の違いなど）は内部キーでまとまります。

  .flex.gap-3.pt-2
    = f.submit "更新", class: "rounded-md bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-zinc-800"
    = link_to "一覧へ", tags_path, class: "rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-50"
